    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Where the fleet's KV lives \u2014 placements by tier",
      "description": "Coordinator's own view. A placement is one place a key is stored: L1 on one server, or one L2 backend. Stacked, so total height is every copy the fleet holds.",
